<title>USA: Patriot American completes Tutwiler buy.</title>
<headline>Patriot American completes Tutwiler buy.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc said on Monday it completed its acquisition of the Tutwiler Hotel in Birmingham, Alabama, from a private party.</p>
<p>The company paid $11 million in cash and operating partnership units for the property.</p>
<p>Grand Heritage Hotels will continue to manage the hotel, the company said. The new owner will immediately begin a $1 million renovation.</p>
<p>The Tutwiler is the second of three hotels the company said in September it would acquire for a total of $29.2 million.</p>
</text>
